  "source": "scripts/npc/<npcId>.js (selections, fares, tickets, warps), scripts/portal/<name>.js for a portal leg, scripts/event/{Hak,Subway,AirPlane,KerningTrain}.js and MapleMap ride timers, NPC placement from wz/Map.wz life",
  "note": "Rides the walking graphs cannot see. A leg boards at fromMapId by talking to npcId with these dialogue selections; it lands on toMapId at once, or after waiting on one of rideMapIds (a waiting room or the ride itself) until the server moves the rider on. A ticket is bought from its seller first. A leg with a portal and npcId 0 boards by walking into that portal (Kerning Square Station's exit starts the train back). minLevel: the NPC lets nobody below it on (Jeff, 50). savedLocation: the script lands the rider where that saved location points (Spinel's and Audrey's world tours, Pison at Florina Beach, Rupi in Happyville, the Mu Lung Dojo's exit), toMapId when nothing is saved; any other landing counts as the ride done. The Dojo's exit lands where the Dojo board saved the rider, so its toMapId is Mu Lung Temple (with nothing saved it is Henesys): planned as Henesys, the board and the exit would look like a way from Mu Lung to Victoria Island. For the same reason Rooney is listed only in Ellinia, where Rupi's way back lands with nothing saved. Shanks sails off Maple Island only; nothing sails back. The Ellinia-Orbis boat is taken with the boarding NPC's 'instantly' option. Left out: taxis and Audrey's hop between Kuala Lumpur and Kampung Village (shortcuts, not the way; the one exception is the NLC taxi to the Haunted House, the only way into the Phantom Forest and Crimsonwood), and Audrey's 42,000-meso flight from the CBD (Spinel at Boat Quay Town flies there for 10,000). The Community Repack areas' entry NPCs (four spawned on shared maps by server.mods.RepackMaps.ENTRIES, the Temple Keeper in Three Doors) take a bot in as they take a Repack client. The way back from Twilight Perion and the nine Arcane River towns is the town guide's offer of Three Doors (server.mods.RepackGuide): those guides have no script of their own and answer through repack_talk.js, as NPCTalkHandler and the bot gateway run it for an unscripted NPC on a Repack map.",
